cff-version: 1.2.0
message: If you use this software, please cite both the software and the paper.
title: PolicySplit
abstract: >-
  Policy-aligned fast-path admission for hybrid P4-SDN intrusion prevention
  in IoT networks. The P4 pipeline, the compiler that pools training
  evidence by action and calibrates each action's threshold on held-out
  flows, the report adjudicator, the BMv2 and Tofino-model test beds, the
  PCAP extraction, and the result records behind every number in the paper.
type: software
license: MIT
repository-code: https://github.com/dinanathpd/PolicySplit
keywords:
  - intrusion prevention
  - Internet of Things
  - programmable data planes
  - software-defined networking
  - selective classification
  - CICIoT2023
